IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `srto-railway-lands`

-- Singapore Railway Transfer Ordinance 1918, ss 2-9 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_singapore-railway-transfer-ordinance-1918.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`pink-plan land unused, 6 months on, YdPN authorises` MEANS Resumption WITH
    `origin` IS `vested by section 2`
    `still used or required for the railway` IS FALSE
    `the Yang di-Pertuan Negara wants it back` IS TRUE
    `months since the Minister's notice` IS 6
    `entry authorised by the Yang di-Pertuan Negara` IS TRUE
    `entry authorised by the Minister` IS FALSE

