`a boatman delayed by the works` MEANS Claim WITH
    `land or an interest in land was injuriously affected` IS FALSE
    `caused by what the Ordinance authorised` IS TRUE
    `arose from executing the works, not their later use` IS TRUE
    `would have been actionable without the Ordinance` IS TRUE
    `claimed for interference with a public or private right` IS FALSE
    `a physical interference with a right that adds market value to the property` IS FALSE

